  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for an investigative journalism project on gender equality and women&#x2019;s empowerment in Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Animal Politico is a digital media outlet in Mexico City that partners with local civil society organizations to provide readers with coverage of initiatives that address social issues. With 2.6 million followers on the social platform X, it has built a loyal and engaged audience, especially among women and youth. With this grant, Animal Politico will deepen its investigative coverage of gender and other social issues in partnership with investigative media groups in Guerrero, Tamaulipas, Chihuahua, Puebla, Sinaloa, and Sonora. (Strategy: Inclusive Governance)</narrative>
  </description>
